    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s a mounted scroll, plus...some kind of\nvase? Definitely collector’s items.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWho knows what they’re worth, but it’s got to be\na lot. Probably better not to touch anything.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
