    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s a scroll mounted on the wall, plus a\nbronze mirror shaped like a Bronzor.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWho knows what they’re worth, but it’s got to be\na lot. Probably better not to touch anything.",
