    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s a mounted hanging scroll, plus a “lucky\nSneasel” statue.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWho knows what they’re worth, but it’s got to be\na lot. Probably better not to touch anything.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
