      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 163
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s some kind of hanging scroll here, plus\nwhat looks like a piece for a board game.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWho knows what they’re worth, but it’s got to be\na lot. Probably better not to touch anything.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
