      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 187
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a vase that seems to be modeled after a\nPokémon that was nicknamed the “sea fiend.”<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt looks like it must be really valuable. Probably\nbetter not to touch it.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 167
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Is...is this a real katana?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nReal or not, it looks dangerous. Probably better\nnot to touch it.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 2580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s no way I’ll lose! There’s still so much I\nneed to do.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 2776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500720065201900730020006E006F0020007700610079002000492019006C006C0020006C006F007300650021002000540068006500720065201900730020007300740069006C006C00200073006F0020006D00750063006800200049000A006E00650065006400200074006F00200064006F002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do me a favor and don’t wander around too much.\nI always got work for you if you’re bored.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We need to do something about that tower.\nOtherwise, honest folk won’t get any peace!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you say to a team competition, like\nTeam MZ versus the Rust Syndicate?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI bet it would be more interesting than anything\nJacinthe could come up with, anyway.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 3280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 172
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m going to have to ask you to keep up with that\nhyperspace survey work. No slacking.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIf you think you’ve accumulated enough points,\nthough, do go report to Philippe there.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 181
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Odd rules and practices in organizations exist\nbecause someone benefits from them.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nTake our interest rates, for example.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 3988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Please let <U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001> know that we look\nforward<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nto<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nseeing<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nh<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȂeris<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlatest<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nvideo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 21,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 4244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Something’s wrong with the very symbol of\nLumiose? That’s a bad omen if I’ve ever seen one.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
